#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:5 0e70d4310e8a407cbde3281eeca030b8
msgid "Video Transmitter Support"
msgstr "图传支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:7 8e0d6cfef6d54815aa595d10b0a3a858
msgid ""
"Video transmitter (VTX) support allows the autopilot to control an attached "
"video transmitter. Depending on the VTX and protocol used, components that "
"can be controlled include video band, video channel, transmitter power and "
"pit mode. Supported protocols are SmartAudio, IRC Tramp, and TBS Crossfire "
"(CRSF)."
msgstr ""
"图传（VTX）支持允许飞控控制所连接的图传设备。根据 VTX 及使用的协议，可控制的组件包括视频频段、视频频道、发射功率和 Pit 模式。支持的协议有 "
"SmartAudio、IRC Tramp 和 TBS Crossfire（CRSF）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:9 e09f0372fbb14933b58c5e2c65d35306
msgid ""
"Not all video transmitters claiming SmartAudio support fully support the "
"specification and some functions may not be provided in that transmitter, or"
" implemented in a non-standard way. Consult the manufacturer's documentation"
" if questions arise."
msgstr "并非所有声称支持 SmartAudio 的图传设备都完全符合该规范，部分功能可能不受支持或以非标准方式实现。如有疑问，请查阅厂商文档。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:12 56903c39a28e4e5eae6b8ffcaf895281
msgid "How to setup video transmitter support"
msgstr "如何配置图传支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:14 9209d171ab114c4690b0945098c41ed8
msgid ""
"To enable video transmitter support you need to set the following parameters"
" and reboot your autopilot:"
msgstr "要启用图传支持，需设置以下参数并重启飞控："

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:16 969d07e4e57f42bfbaf565976b11c6c4
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`VTX_ENABLE <VTX_ENABLE>` to 1 to enable video transmitter support."
" Although this enables support it will not achieve anything without an "
"appropriate video transmitter protocol enabled, as described below."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`VTX_ENABLE <VTX_ENABLE>` 设置为 1 "
"以启用图传支持。虽然此参数启用了支持，但还需启用合适的图传协议才能实际使用，详见下文。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:19 73e01eef54a543438935d0cb00e943f3
msgid "SmartAudio"
msgstr "SmartAudio"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:21 de09eafc86ce486388b17602529414b3
msgid ""
"SmartAudio is a one-wire protocol so you will need to connect the SmartAudio"
" pin of your VTX to the TX pin of the serial port you want to use. You will "
"also need to make sure your VTX is configured for SmartAudio control. For "
"example if attached to SERIAL port 5:"
msgstr ""
"SmartAudio 是单线协议，需将 VTX 的 SmartAudio 引脚连接到所用串口的 TX 引脚。还需确保 VTX 已配置为 "
"SmartAudio 控制模式。例如，连接到 SERIAL5 端口时："

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:23 16bb557664f044548c5e796ea746b6e9
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL <SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` to 37 to enable SmartAudio."
msgstr "将 :ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL <SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` 设置为 37 以启用 SmartAudio。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:24 312388b9bd47425e8dfe3aa4829b0b47
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS <SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` to 4 to enable half-duplex "
"which SmartAudio requires. Depending on your video transmitter it might be "
"required to enable the TX_PullDown option, so 68 would be the correct value."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS <SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` 设置为 4 以启用 SmartAudio "
"所需的半双工模式。根据图传设备，可能还需要启用 TX_PullDown 选项，此时正确值为 68。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:25 51c7eaabbd5940948a52ce19601bbf43
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SERIAL5_BAUD <SERIAL5_BAUD>` to 4800 to set the SmartAudio baud "
"rate"
msgstr "将 :ref:`SERIAL5_BAUD <SERIAL5_BAUD>` 设置为 4800，以设置 SmartAudio 波特率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:31 caaf5285c0dc4f4b92361c6efd1fb09a
msgid "CRSF (Crossfire)"
msgstr "CRSF（Crossfire）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:33 e50d44b8b6d847c68f4fc36c5f751ba0
msgid ""
"CRSF is a bi-directional protocol that requires both TX and RX of a serial "
"port to be connected. Follow the instructions for CRSF telemetry to setup "
"CRSF support (See :ref:`common-tbs-rc`). If you only wish to use CRSF for "
"VTX support, then (again using SERIAL5 as an example) :ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL"
" <SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` should be set to 29 rather than 23. You will also need "
"to make sure your VTX is configured for CRSF control."
msgstr ""
"CRSF 是双向协议，需将串口的 TX 和 RX 均连接。请按照 CRSF 数传的说明配置 CRSF 支持（参见 :ref:`common-tbs-"
"rc`）。如仅需将 CRSF 用于图传控制，（同样以 SERIAL5 为例）:ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL "
"<SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` 应设置为 29 而非 23。还需确保 VTX 已配置为 CRSF 控制模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:35 e70824f8cda04b9c9246b825bc1a63a9
msgid ""
"When using CRSF for both RC/Telem and VTX control it is important to disable"
" \"my VTX\" support on Open TX transmitters. Follow your transmitters' "
"instructions. In this scenario, you must connect your autopilot's UART to "
"your CRSF receiver, and then connect your CRSF receiver to the VTX to "
"forward CRSF commands, you cannot connect to the FC using CRSF directly for "
"both the Receiver and VTX using two UARTs."
msgstr ""
"同时使用 CRSF 进行 RC/数传和图传控制时，务必在 OpenTX 遥控器上禁用「my VTX」支持，请参阅遥控器说明。此场景下，必须将飞控的 "
"UART 连接到 CRSF 接收机，再由接收机转发 CRSF 指令至 VTX，不能用两路 UART 同时直连飞控的接收机和 VTX。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:37 544c1e24373b43069fed212472344ff8
msgid ""
"Reboot your autopilot and power your video transmitter. At startup you "
"should see a video message indicating the current video settings. All the "
"video settings are stored in the ``VTX_x`` parameters and by default these "
"will be changed to reflect the currently configured VTX settings. Once "
"booted you can modify these settings and they will be reflected in the VTX "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"重启飞控并给图传上电。启动时应看到显示当前视频设置的视频消息。所有视频设置均存储在 ``VTX_x`` 参数中，默认情况下这些参数将更新以反映当前 "
"VTX 配置。启动后可修改这些设置，修改将同步到 VTX 配置中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:48 6957b3bed1914aa1b334de3bdafcef5d
msgid "ImmersionRC Tramp"
msgstr "ImmersionRC Tramp"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:50 a6effbe80b0e4cbb9ac3fc57fe869766
msgid ""
"Connect the telemtry pin of the video transmitter to the TX pin of the "
"autopilot's UART used to control it."
msgstr "将图传的数传引脚连接到飞控用于控制它的 UART 的 TX 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:51 4f03fa2577ea48d8ae8b28359ac569b8
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL <SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` = 44 if using SERIAL5 for "
"connection to VTX"
msgstr ""
"如使用 SERIAL5 连接 VTX，则设置 :ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL <SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` = 44"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:54 a6a6e1fc1f2943ad8591c6e795b88765
msgid "Video transmitter settings"
msgstr "图传设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:56 e4677ded2d6f44ab94d0f6092a81ba88
msgid "Set :ref:`VTX_BAND <VTX_BAND>` to modify the VTX band."
msgstr "设置 :ref:`VTX_BAND <VTX_BAND>` 以修改 VTX 频段。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:57 1134b96207d447508ef95a53e641b8bf
msgid "Set :ref:`VTX_CHANNEL <VTX_CHANNEL>` to modify the VTX channel."
msgstr "设置 :ref:`VTX_CHANNEL <VTX_CHANNEL>` 以修改 VTX 频道。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:58 1a8582ffe18948a796f49733d7ba32a9
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`VTX_FREQ <VTX_FREQ>` to modify the VTX frequency. Band/channel and"
" frequency are mutually exclusive, if you set band and/or channel then the "
"frequency will be automatically updated. If you set the frequency then the "
"band/channel will be automatically updated. Not all frequencies, channels "
"and bands are supported unless the transmitter is unlocked. Please consult "
"local regulations before doing this. If you select an unsupported frequency "
"then the current frequency will not be changed."
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`VTX_FREQ <VTX_FREQ>` 以修改 VTX "
"频率。频段/频道与频率互斥：设置频段和/或频道后频率将自动更新；设置频率后频段/频道将自动更新。并非所有频率、频道和频段均受支持，除非图传已解锁。请在操作前查阅当地法规。如选择不支持的频率，当前频率不会改变。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:59 eb4e2d82ba1448e2aa732d491294a30b
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`VTX_POWER <VTX_POWER>` to modify the VTX power in mw. Not all "
"transmitters support all power values. In particular in Europe only 25mw is "
"allowed by default. To allow other values the transmitter must be unlocked. "
"If you select a power level that is unsupported by the transmitter then the "
"actual power value will not be changed."
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`VTX_POWER <VTX_POWER>` 以修改 VTX 发射功率（单位 "
"mW）。并非所有图传都支持所有功率值。特别是在欧洲，默认仅允许 25mW。若要使用其他功率值，必须解锁图传。如选择图传不支持的功率值，实际功率不会改变。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:60 3eb09a4c0dca4d0fb73c8a56cb14a7bc
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`VTX_MAX_POWER <VTX_MAX_POWER>` to set the maximum VTX power "
"allowed in mw. This is used by ``RCx_OPTION`` = 94 which allows the VTX "
"power to be changed via a switch or dial."
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`VTX_MAX_POWER <VTX_MAX_POWER>` 以设置允许的最大 VTX 功率（单位 mW）。此参数供 "
"``RCx_OPTION`` = 94 使用，允许通过开关或旋钮改变 VTX 功率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:61 1d4be6e48bb94936b299e0e9c7e8ffcd
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`VTX_OPTIONS <VTX_OPTIONS>` to set options on the VTX. The most "
"common option is setting bit 0 which puts the VTX into pit mode, if "
"supported. Other options can be used to reset pitmode upon arming and/or set"
" it upon disarming (bits 1 and 2). The option bits and their actions are "
"shown below:"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`VTX_OPTIONS <VTX_OPTIONS>` 以设置 VTX 选项。最常用的是设置第 0 位，将 VTX 置于 Pit "
"模式（如受支持）。其他选项可用于在解锁时重置 Pit 模式和/或在上锁时启用（第 1 位和第 2 位）。各选项位及其功能如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:64 0868d7a8b7c84676b2cd97bc674d0100
msgid ":ref:`VTX_OPTIONS<VTX_OPTIONS>` bit"
msgstr ":ref:`VTX_OPTIONS<VTX_OPTIONS>` 位"

