msgstr "「解锁」的方式因图传品牌而异。此外，使用解锁的频率/功率等级可能违反当地法律法规。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:79 80e13db303f340c0a227148e14538984
msgid "Setting video transmitter settings"
msgstr "设置图传参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:81 4ec670d04abf4940b2561d32c3e18ca6
msgid ""
"Video transmitter settings can be changed in multiple ways but always go via"
" the ``VTX_x`` parameters. So any option which advertises VTX control will "
"be setting a ``VTX_x`` parameter which in turn will interface with the "
"protocol backends. Here are the current ways that video transmitter settings"
" can be modified:"
msgstr ""
"图传设置可通过多种方式修改，但最终均通过 ``VTX_x`` 参数生效。因此，任何声称支持 VTX 控制的选项都是在设置 ``VTX_x`` "
"参数，进而与协议后端交互。以下是当前可修改图传设置的方式："

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:83 373d254fb06345fa8a9715d009018d27
msgid "Parameter modification through your ground station"
msgstr "通过地面站修改参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:84 e08aa8abba3e4e47a393072cd734900e
msgid ""
"Transmitter power via RC switch (``RCx_OPTION`` = 94). With this setting, "
"the RC channel is interpreted as a 6-position switch (dividing the PWM range"
" 1200 to 1800), and then this is assigned to power values based on the "
"``VTX_MAX_POWER``. For example if max power is 200-499mW, switch positions 0"
" results in 0mw (pit mode), 1 and 2 result in 25mw, 3 and 4 result in 100mw,"
" and 5 results in 200mw."
msgstr ""
"通过 RC 开关调整发射功率（``RCx_OPTION`` = 94）。使用此设置时，RC 通道被解释为 6 档开关（将 PWM 范围 "
"1200～1800 均分），然后根据 ``VTX_MAX_POWER`` 映射到对应功率值。例如，最大功率为 200～499mW 时，档位 0 对应 "
"0mW（Pit 模式），档位 1 和 2 对应 25mW，档位 3 和 4 对应 100mW，档位 5 对应 200mW。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:85 95e8c772849e4cd1bc828d74b58d2efa
msgid "Parameter modification via the OSD (See :ref:`common-paramosd`)"
msgstr "通过 OSD 修改参数（参见 :ref:`common-paramosd`）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:86 abe211d2e7134ff4b213ca9da58a8d58
msgid ""
"Parameter modification via CRSF OpenTX lua scripts (or OpenTX AgentX lua "
"scripts) - CRSF only"
msgstr "通过 CRSF OpenTX lua 脚本（或 OpenTX AgentX lua 脚本）修改参数——仅限 CRSF"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vtx.rst:87 c9e3b7a1620e47a2b4ba77f8f18287c9
msgid ""
"Spektrum VTX support. VTX settings on your Spektrum transmitter will be "
"translated by either the DSMX or SRXL2 drivers and the appropriate VTX "
"settings updated"
msgstr ""
"Spektrum VTX 支持。Spektrum 遥控器上的 VTX 设置将由 DSMX 或 SRXL2 驱动程序转换并更新相应的 VTX 设置"
